		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Beautiful but eyeless, ivory- skinned demoness with a long, barbed tail. Offers gifts in exchange for a soul pact.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 41, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +4 (1d8) or brand or teleport, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Brand</strong>. Put master's brand on willing mortal and grant them one wish, no spellcasting check. Mortal becomes chaotic, demonically tainted. Brand is always visible, cannot be hidden or concealed.</p><p></p><p><strong>Teleport</strong>. Teleport within distant.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
